Thus every source in $B_2$ has acquired base in
$\operatorname{int}K_2$.  VI, Lemma 13.2, gives the strict enclosures

$$
\begin{gathered}
0.5195359430<r_2<0.5195359431,\qquad
0.0422838313<b_2<0.0422838314,\\
